      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Jambore 3 is a compact circus play station from our Clown Capade series. A jester-hat canopy in Crazy Pink and Baby Blue sits over a round platform, with a climbing ladder on one side and a slide on the other. The playful canopy makes it easy to spot across a garden, which younger children like. It is designed for ages 3 to 9, and the play is simple: climb up the ladder and slide down. The product area is 9'11\" x 13'5\" and the safe play area is 15'11\" x 19'5\", so it suits a pre-school, a small society play corner or a restaurant garden. Capacity is listed as 15 children. Galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope have a 3-year warranty. Ask us for a quote and a layout drawing."
